### 회원가입
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "testuser01",
  "password": "Test1234!@#",
  "userName": "홍길동",
  "birthday": "19900101",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "address": "서울시 강남구"
}

### 내 정보 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/users/me
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!@#

### 비밀번호 변경
PATCH {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!@#

{
  "currentPassword": "Test1234!@#",
  "newPassword": "NewPass5678$"
}
